{"reviews":[{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-0","r":1.0,"t":"changed formula","x":"I have been using this foundation for 30 years.  Always an outstanding, smooth, beautiful coverage...and would receive many compliments. .  But, for some reason Max Factor decided to not only change the formula, but also package the foundation in much smaller containers.  This new formula does not even come close to what it was before.  It's too creamy...almost greasy, and practically slides off your face.  I am so disappointed!  Shame on Max Factor!!!!  What were you thinking???  Please bring b","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-1","r":5.0,"t":"Love the makeup but would like to see a better container","x":"I have used this product for years. The stick part is nice but if a person wants to get their money\u2019s worth after you get down so far you have to dig the makeup out. There is a lot of makeup left in there. If it was a liquid that would be like leaving a fourth of a bottle in there and then throwing it away.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-2","r":5.0,"t":"So happy to find this product again.","x":"I used this stuff in high school and loved it. Couldn't find it at local stores. Finally found it here and it is just as amazing as I remember. I did get 2 colors, and both work great.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-3","r":5.0,"t":"I love it as I am allergic to so many other ...","x":"I have used this product for over 50 years. I love it as I am allergic to so many other makeup foundations. I was so happy to be able to purchase it through Amazon.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great product, my wife is no longer able to ...","x":"Great product, my wife is no longer able to locate  it in any local stores...Fantastic price with FREE SHIPPING .....Something that always catches my attention.....Happy wife is a happy life....THANKS....!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-5","r":5.0,"t":"Max Factor Panstick","x":"I love this foundation.  It covers well, including spider veins.  Always come back to purchase. Delivery was fast and on time.  Appreciate the reasonable price. Recommend the seller and product highly.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-6","r":5.0,"t":"Best foundation ever !!","x":"Best coverage ! No skin irritation, doesn't dry skin out, been using this product 28 years. Would recommend to all...","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-7","r":5.0,"t":"Max FActor Panstik - A long time customer","x":"I have used this product for over 40 years.  Max FActor has moved from the US to Ireland.  I have been buying from this vendor for at least a couple of years and my supply arrives in  a timely manner and is the exact product I wanted.  Max FActor Panstik is an excellent makeup.  Nice coverage and lasts all day.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-8","r":5.0,"t":"Been using this Max Factor Pan Stick since the 80's ...","x":"Been using this Max Factor Pan Stick since the 80's .  Same color too. True Beige..  Smaller container, but will still purchase as it is rarely if ever sold in stores","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-9","r":5.0,"t":"High quality","x":"Love love this pan stick.  Wonderful coverage.  I use Jerome alexazander magic minerals as base and pat some over the panstick.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-10","r":5.0,"t":"Best foundation","x":"This is the best full coverage foundation that I have ever tried.  I have used it for decades and will not use anything else.  I am very grateful that Max Factor pan stick makeup is still being manufactured in the UK.  I can't praise this product enough.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great coverage and moisture","x":"My Mom has been using this product for years and years and she has beautiful skin and people think she\u2019s my sister!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-12","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I've been wearing this for 25+ years- Love it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-13","r":5.0,"t":"The best foundation ever made:","x":"When Max Factor stopped making this, my wife panicked.  I was so glad to find it for her on Amazon. The number 12 is the color equivalent to the old Nude Ivory color. It is a bit smaller in size, but the quality is the same. Also, purchasing it in the multi pack will last quite a while and save money. Highly recommended.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great coverage!","x":"Been using Max Factor for many many years! Only been using the smaller version for about 2-3 years. But I like the fact that it is small and can travel easily with you in a small purse for a touch up. Good coverage, lots of color choices . Wouldn\u2019t be without it!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-15","r":5.0,"t":"My tried & true","x":"I've worn this pan stick since I turned 15.  It has been consistent for 40 years.  I believe it has helped my 55 year old face to age gracefully.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-16","r":5.0,"t":"It was a gift for my mom","x":"My mother used this when she was young and it was her favorite. She was so excited to know Amazon had it and she still uses it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-17","r":5.0,"t":"Best product ever!!!","x":"I have Lupus and this is the only make up i can use that conceals the loss of pigment spots. Thank you Max Factor","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-18","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent product","x":"Excellent product. I used this for years until it wasn\u2019t on the market. So glad to have found it here.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-19","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I have Loved Pan Stik for many many years and I wish it would come back into the stores!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-20","r":5.0,"t":"Wife loves it","x":"Have to wait on shipping but my wife loves it so I order it..","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-21","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Great product only takes to long ip ship","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-22","r":5.0,"t":"Wow! Yay! Woo-Hoo!","x":"Dont even think twice, just buy this makeup. I started wearing Pan Stick when I was 20 and I will be 70 on my next birthday. My mom wore it too, from her high school years well into her 80s. True Beige #12 is famous for it's ability to camouflage redness. Over the years I admit I strayed sometimes. Got distracted by fancy packaging, big dollar ad campaigns, magazine ads, etc. BUT nothing compares to Max Factor Pan Stick. The coverage. The creamy consistency. The high pigmentation, better than an","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-23","r":4.0,"t":"Max Factor Panstik Foundation - 12 True Beige is not like the original, but it's okay.","x":"Since Max Factor Panstik is no longer made in the United States, we who used it have to depend on the foreign made product.  If you used the older version, you will find that this is not the same thing.  The color 12 True Beige is similar to the old product, but it doesn't cover quite as well.  The price on this is good, but it is half the size of the old Panstik.  Bite a bullet and try it.  You might even like it better.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00QHB2J2S-24","r":3.0,"t":"Color is not accurate.","x":"I have always worn True Beige for many, many years and now the color is lighter than normal.  Also, the oz size is much smaller , but the price stays the same.  I am not sure I will order this again after being my one and only preferred make up for more years that I can count.!!!!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers have used this foundation for decades and remain loyal to it.","cites":[1,4,7,8,9,11,13,14]},{"text":"Reviewers praise the full, smooth coverage it provides.","cites":[1,6,7,8,10,11,12,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain the container is smaller and wastes product that can't be reached.","cites":[1,2,9,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers are glad to find the product online since it is hard to locate in local stores.","cites":[3,4,5,9,14]},{"text":"Reviewers appreciate the reasonable price and fast delivery.","cites":[5,6,8]}]},"qa":[]}